WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.550
Check yourself with two questions
from the module's knowledge check.

2
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:08.041
First: why does the evidence export
get its own evidence reader role,

3
00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.287
instead of reusing the verifier's?

4
00:00:10.287 --> 00:00:11.512
The answer is b.

5
00:00:11.512 --> 00:00:15.450
With the verifier's role, the
export could also close findings.

6
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.150
The reader can't change a
record it's about to hash.

7
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:19.875
Roles are split by task.

8
00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:24.763
Second: Gate 1 asks you to record which
actions run from a vendor's cloud.

9
00:00:24.763 --> 00:00:25.450
Why?

10
00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:26.587
The answer is a.

11
00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:31.421
The workbook's design prefers execution
through a connector inside the boundary,

12
00:00:31.421 --> 00:00:34.762
so each vendor-cloud action
becomes a recorded data flow.

13
00:00:34.762 --> 00:00:39.720
The module page has two more questions,
each linked to the section that answers it.
